# RLL-1 local automation — {{REPOSITORY}}

This is a thin repository adapter for Common Engineering Relay V3.1 RLL-1.

Required Common basis: `{{REQUIRED_COMMON_BASIS}}`.

## Architecture

```text
Antigravity schedule sidecar
  -> repository PowerShell wrapper
  -> Common V3.1 rll_worker.py
  -> deterministic git + gh transport
  -> one agy -p engineering run
  -> GitHub evidence
```

## Install smoke mode

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/install-rll1-antigravity-sidecar.ps1 `
  -CommonRoot "C:\path\to\Common" `
  -PilotIssue <issue>
```

## Enable execution

After smoke review:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/install-rll1-antigravity-sidecar.ps1 `
  -CommonRoot "C:\path\to\Common" `
  -PilotIssue <issue> `
  -EnableExecution
```

Use `BRANCH_RESUME` only for a governed source-write branch.
Use `EXACT_HEAD_EVIDENCE` for read-only immutable-head execution.

Never use transport state as engineering PASS/FAIL.
Never use RLL to infer merge/release authority.
